  "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
  "instance_name": "mapping_id_1",
  "label": "The collective mourning scene is mapped onto the textual narrative of a child's death due to Israeli bombing.",
  "description": "The visual entity 'collective_mourning' — depicting men in intense grief and protest — is analogically mapped to the textual narrative 'when god grants you a child after 20 years of your marriage and israel bombs him few years later'. The image of collective anguish serves as a visual representation of the profound personal tragedy described in the text, framing the loss of a child as a communal and political event. The emotional intensity of the visual material (grief, rage, protest) is projected onto the textual material to evoke empathy and associate the personal loss with the broader geopolitical context of Israeli bombing in Palestine.",
